{
  "key": "ia-agreement",
  "typeName": "Independent Auditors' Agreement",
  "source": "Derived 20 October 2026 from the approved IA agreement pack (5 Packs to check/04b IA agreement, cut from the firm's June 2026 IA agreement) by reading its headings with skeletonCheck.js, and compared with the IE agreement, which has the same frame. Presence: an article (level 1) is \"always\" when every firm precedent of the family read for the study has it, \"optional\" when it belongs to one deal or one form, and \"decision\" when a drafting decision (decisions/ia-agreement.json) turns it on or off. Sections (level 2) are the pack's own, all optional except the ones every precedent has; they are listed so that a section the firm already uses is never reported as a new clause.",
